# 📜 Changelog  
All notable changes to DexLang & DexIDE will be documented here.

This project follows a simple versioning style:  
`vYEAR.MONTH.DAY`

---

## ✅ v2025.12.05 — Initial Beast Release

### 🚀 DexLang
- Added Lexer  
- Added Parser  
- Added Interpreter  
- Added AST system  
- Added variables, arithmetic, loops, if/else  
- Added print  
- Added block support `{ ... }`  

### 🖥️ DexIDE
- Added GUI editor  
- Added Run button  
- Added Build system  
- Added `.dex-output` folder  
- Added `.dexDump` history system  
- Added console output  
- Added project root selection  

---

## ✅ Planned Updates

### 🔤 DexLang
- String support  
- Arrays  
- Functions  
- Input system  
- Standard library  

### 🎨 DexIDE
- Syntax highlighting  
- Themes  
- Tabs for multiple files  
- Plugin system  
- Debugger  

---

## 🐉 Stay tuned — the beast evolves.
